    "detailed_description": "<strong>Notice: A controller is strongly recommended to play this game </strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1347250/extras/27487d764c7914ead699fcbe3f82507c.avif?t=1734862086\" /></div><br><br>A new life was presented before us\u2026 New planet, new city ... But they attacked us ... And they killed our parents. But luckily Xander picked us up. We have spent all these years training, learning, becoming the best with one goal in mind. THE REVENGE<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1347250/extras/86c26ba076001d379e29e65782e30be9.poster.avif?t=1734862086\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1347250/extras/86c26ba076001d379e29e65782e30be9.webm?t=1734862086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1347250/extras/86c26ba076001d379e29e65782e30be9.mp4?t=1734862086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Space Revenge - Prologue is an action-exploration game. Get ready to assault the enemy's base and get your desired revenge!<br>With a top down perspective, twin stick controls and a sci-fi mood to explore the enemy base full of dangers. The BSO will make you feel the tension of the game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1347250/extras/5882c8df5a1c1ae9aaacf67d55121032.avif?t=1734862086\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1347250/extras/ea6b88969622da21a7e37ff2c4526b10.avif?t=1734862086\" /></div><br><br>\ud83d\ude80 The game features 1 level.<br>\ud83d\ude80 Gorgeous 3D graphics<br>\ud83d\ude80 Intense combat action to keep you engaged.<br>\ud83d\ude80 Use the environment to your own advantage<br>\ud83d\ude80 Ambient soundtrack <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1347250/extras/c16fac8fe829aaef3490dba204db669e.avif?t=1734862086\" /></div><br><br><strong>This game works best with a controller, and it is strongly recommended.</strong>",
